; kilim.router (design section 06): the routes of an app, the History API as
; tasks and a subscription, and the links. It uses only the standard library
; and kilim, thus kilim.testing can mock it (History_mock). The browser part is
; kilim.router.browser (src/router/browser). test/link makes sure that it uses
; none of Printf, Format, Scanf, Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or Printexc.

(library
 (name kilim_router)
 (public_name kilim.router)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
